---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
---

<PageLayout
  title="Privacy Policy · FedEthics Inc."
  description="FedEthics Inc. Privacy Policy: what personal data we collect, why we collect it, the third parties involved, and the choices available to you."
>
<!-- PAGE HERO -->
    <div class="page-hero">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="eyebrow">Legal</div>
        <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p>This policy explains what personal information FedEthics Inc. collects through this website, why we collect it, who processes it, and how you can access or delete your data.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- LEGAL CONTENT -->
    <section class="legal-section">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="legal-content">
          <p class="legal-updated">Last updated: August 5th, 2026</p>

          <h2>Who we are</h2>
          <p>FedEthics Inc. ("FedEthics", "we", "us") operates the website <strong>fedethics.ca</strong>. If you have any questions about this policy or your personal data, contact us at <a href="mailto:hello-bonjour@fedethics.ca">hello-bonjour@fedethics.ca</a>.</p>

          <h2>What data we collect and why</h2>
          <p>We only collect personal information that you actively provide, plus limited technical analytics data. We do not sell your personal information.</p>

          <div class="table-scroll">
            <table class="legal-table">
              <thead>
                <tr><th>Data</th><th>When it is collected</th><th>Why we collect it</th></tr>
              </thead>
              <tbody>
                <tr>
                  <td>Your email address</td>
                  <td>When you subscribe to the FedEthics Dispatch newsletter</td>
                  <td>To send you the newsletter (AI governance insights, book updates, and speaking announcements). You can unsubscribe at any time.</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                  <td>Usage &amp; device data (pages viewed, approximate location, browser type, referring links)</td>
                  <td>Automatically, via cookies, once you accept analytics cookies</td>
                  <td>To understand how the site is used so we can improve it. See "Cookies and analytics" below.</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                  <td>Payment details</td>
                  <td>When you buy a book</td>
                  <td>Payments are processed entirely by Stripe. FedEthics never receives or stores your full card details.</td>
                </tr>
              </tbody>
            </table>
          </div>

          <!-- <div class="legal-callout">
            <p><strong>Contact form will collect:</strong> name, email, phone, and organization.</p>
            <p><strong>Note on the contact form:</strong> the contact form on this site is not currently active and does not transmit or store submissions. If it is enabled in the future, this policy will be updated first to describe the additional information it collects (name, email, phone, and organization) and how that data is handled.</p>
          </div> -->
          <!--
            MAINTAINER NOTE: Before activating the contact form (replacing the
            placeholder Formspree ID in contact.html), update the table above to
            include: first name, last name, email, phone, and organization, with
            purpose "to respond to your enquiry", and add Formspree to the
            third-parties list below.
          -->

          <h2>Cookies and analytics</h2>
          <p>We use <strong>Google Analytics</strong> and <strong>Google Tag Manager</strong> to measure how visitors use the site. These tools set cookies only <strong>after you give consent</strong> through the cookie banner shown on your first visit. Until you accept, analytics run in a consent-denied mode that does not store identifying cookies.</p>
          <p>You can change your choice at any time by clearing this site's cookies in your browser, which will make the consent banner appear again on your next visit.</p>

          <h2>Third parties who process your data</h2>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>Google (Analytics &amp; Tag Manager)</strong> — website usage measurement. See Google's <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Privacy Policy</a>.</li>
            <li><strong>Stripe</strong> — secure payment processing for book orders. See Stripe's <a href="https://stripe.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Privacy Policy</a>.</li>
            <li><strong>Newsletter delivery</strong> — your email is stored solely to operate the FedEthics Dispatch newsletter and is not shared for any other purpose.</li>
          </ul>

          <h2>How long we keep your data</h2>
          <p>We keep your newsletter email address until you unsubscribe or ask us to delete it. Analytics data is retained according to Google Analytics' standard retention settings. Payment records held by Stripe are governed by Stripe's own policies.</p>

          <h2>How to access or delete your data</h2>
          <p>You have the right to access, correct, or delete the personal information we hold about you. To do so:</p>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>Newsletter:</strong> click "unsubscribe" in any newsletter email, or email us at <a href="mailto:hello-bonjour@fedethics.ca">hello-bonjour@fedethics.ca</a> and we will remove your address.</li>
            <li><strong>Any other data:</strong> email <a href="mailto:hello-bonjour@fedethics.ca">hello-bonjour@fedethics.ca</a> with your request. We will respond within 72 hours.</li>
          </ul>
          <p>Because we operate from Canada, we handle personal information in accordance with the Personal Information Protection and Electronic Documents Act (PIPEDA).</p>

          <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
          <p>We may update this policy from time to time. When we do, we will revise the "Last updated" date at the top of this page.</p>

          <h2>Contact</h2>
          <p>Questions about your privacy or this policy? Email <a href="mailto:hello-bonjour@fedethics.ca">hello-bonjour@fedethics.ca</a>.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
</PageLayout>

<style>
/* PAGE HERO */
      .page-hero{
        background:var(--ink);
        padding:80px 0 64px;
        position:relative;overflow:hidden;
      }.page-hero::before{
        content:'';position:absolute;right:-80px;top:-80px;
        width:500px;height:500px;border-radius:50%;
        background:radial-gradient(circle,rgba(184,144,58,.08) 0%,transparent 70%);
        pointer-events:none;
      }.page-hero .eyebrow{color:var(--gold-bright);}.page-hero .eyebrow::before{background:var(--gold-bright);}.page-hero h1{font-family:var(--serif);font-size:clamp(2.2rem,4.2vw,3.2rem);font-weight:600;color:var(--white);margin-bottom:18px;line-height:1.1;letter-spacing:-.02em;}.page-hero p{font-size:1.05rem;color:rgba(255,255,255,.65);max-width:620px;line-height:1.8;}/* LEGAL CONTENT */
      .legal-section{background:var(--parchment);padding:72px 0 96px;}.legal-content{max-width:760px;margin:0 auto;}.legal-content h2{
        font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.5rem;font-weight:600;
        color:var(--ink);margin:44px 0 14px;letter-spacing:-.01em;
      }.legal-content h2:first-of-type{margin-top:0;}.legal-content h3{
        font-size:1rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--ink);margin:24px 0 8px;
      }.legal-content p,.legal-content li{
        font-size:1rem;color:var(--text-body);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:14px;
      }.legal-content ul{margin:0 0 14px 22px;}.legal-content li{margin-bottom:8px;}.legal-content a{color:var(--gold);text-decoration:underline;}.legal-content a:hover{color:var(--navy);}.legal-content strong{color:var(--ink);}.legal-updated{
        font-size:.85rem;color:var(--text-muted);
        padding-bottom:24px;margin-bottom:32px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--rule);
      }.legal-table{
        width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin:8px 0 24px;
        font-size:.94rem;
      }.legal-table th,.legal-table td{
        text-align:left;padding:12px 14px;border:1px solid var(--rule);
        vertical-align:top;line-height:1.6;color:var(--text-body);
      }.legal-table th{background:var(--off-white);color:var(--ink);font-weight:600;}.legal-callout{
        background:var(--gold-wash);border:1px solid rgba(184,144,58,0.25);
        border-radius:var(--r-md);padding:18px 22px;margin:24px 0;
      }.legal-callout p{margin:0;color:var(--text-mid);font-size:.95rem;}.table-scroll{overflow-x:auto;}
    
</style>
